  "prefLabel": "Rev 1608.05 Estimated Payments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1608.05 Estimated Payments.\n\n(a) Estimated payments shall be filed with the department, using Form DP 135-ES.\n\n(b) The penalties of RSA 21-J:32 shall apply to underpayment of estimated payments in (a) above.\n\nSource. #6336, eff 9-24-96 (from Rev 1611); ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1607.05); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
